{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fake World 2: Real World 1</strong> is an <strong>atmospheric VR first-person shooter</strong> that fuses <strong>high-mobility platforming</strong> with intense combat. Grapple, jetpack, fly, and teleport as you fight your way through surreal environments.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR Combat, Your Way</strong> \u2013 Blast enemies with fast-paced FPS action designed for full VR immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom of Movement</strong> \u2013 Use your grappling hook, jetpack, and teleport abilities to swing, soar, and dodge in three-dimensional landscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming Meets Shooter</strong> \u2013 Leap, climb, and fly through handcrafted levels where traversal is as important as combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color-Matched Weapons</strong> \u2013 Wield red and yellow swords and guns, swapping colors to break defenses, exploit weaknesses, and overcome enemies in combat built around precision and action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Linear, Focused Campaign</strong> \u2013 Experience a streamlined journey designed to challenge and thrill.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965200?t=1757942926","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965200?t=1757942926","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965200/399d51f0eeb839d4d214553b84191bcdd0f532be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757942926","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965200/399d51f0eeb839d4d214553b84191bcdd0f532be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757942926","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},